Current model selection
=======================

The current original, unscaled adapter and speaker embedding come from v3's
checkpoint-epoch-3 (epoch_index 3, epoch_number 4). Its validation loss is
2.5563672079759487. The model was selected by listening preference, balancing
the target voice and word-to-word continuity; it is not the full-run validation
best checkpoint (epoch 9, approximately 2.4813). Validation sets differ between
model generations, so validation loss is not used as a cross-version percentage
measure of voice quality.

Public provenance is recorded in lora/checkpoint_meta.json without local
absolute paths. The released adapter is not pre-scaled. Local CustomVoice export
applies scale 0.8 once before merging into the original Base; inference loads
that merged model without applying another adapter or another scale factor.

