Historical community training corrections
=========================================

Source: https://github.com/instavar/qwen3-tts-lora-finetuning
License: Apache-2.0; upstream copy: licenses/Instavar-Apache-2.0.txt
Patch: https://github.com/instavar/qwen3-tts-lora-finetuning/blob/main/patches/0001-qwen3-tts-lora.patch

Credit to Instavar and the project's contributors for the text projection,
manual codec-0 loss and sub-talker training workflow referenced during model
development. The project's subsequent correction computes cross-entropy
directly for the already aligned c1 through c15 logits and targets, avoiding a
second label shift in the generic causal loss; training, validation and
per-epoch evaluation use the same correction. This is a provenance credit;
the patch and local training implementations are not included in this package.
The upstream license copy and Qwen notices remain available for that provenance.

